---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  noindex={true}
  title="Limits"
  description="Short summary of Image Identifier limits — evidence only, not authenticity certification."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-fg m-0">Limits</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Results describe evidence available in the file you selected. They are not legal, journalistic,
      or forensic certification.
    </p>
    <ul class="text-muted pl-5 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
      <li>Absence of signals does not mean an image is authentic.</li>
      <li>Presence of camera-related fields does not prove authenticity.</li>
      <li>Statistical scores are error-prone and optional.</li>
      <li>Conflicting signals are preserved on purpose.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Longer write-up: <a href="/limits/">Provenance limits</a>. Guides:
      <a href="/guides/">all guides</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-muted">
      <a href="/">← Back to the tool</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
